                "fontFamily": "Inter",
                "text": "The one chooser on these faces that is NOT pick-one: the click sounds on a bitmask of hardware outputs, so several cells are lit at once, a tap toggles one bit rather than replacing the answer, and nothing here closes the grid \u2014 no single tap ends the question. The row summarises: nowhere \/ all outputs \/ Out 1 \u00b7 Out 2 \/ N outputs once naming them all would not fit."
